   "title": "Read me - files",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## P-H3-Image - files\n| folder | file | size |\n|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | **p-h3-image_int8_convrot** (best quality) | 21.2 GB |\n| diffusion_models | p-h3-image_w4a8 (smaller cards) | 13.4 GB |\n| text_encoders | **p-h3-image_text_encoder_int8_convrot** | 5.1 GB |\n| text_encoders | p-h3-image_text_encoder_w4a8 (smaller cards) | 3.6 GB |\n| text_encoders | p-h3-image_prompt_upsampler_int8_convrot (optional) | 9.7 GB |\n| vae | p-h3-image_vae_int8_convrot | 3.1 GB |\n\nAll `.safetensors`, from **PrunaAI/P-H3-Image-Comfy** on Hugging Face. Built-in nodes: update ComfyUI to the latest version (tested on 0.45.0). rgthree for the toggle panel, the prompt switch and the before/after comparer.\nLicence: MiniMax H3 Community License - read it on the model page before you use it.\nWorkflow by TheLocalLab, built on PrunaAI's official workflow."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## MiniMax H3-Image - files\n| folder | file | size |\n|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | **minimax_h3_image_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors** (best quality) | 20.98 GB |\n| diffusion_models | minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors (low VRAM, 6-8 GB) | 12.55 GB |\n| text_encoders | qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors | 27.14 GB |\n| text_encoders | qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors (prompt expander, optional) | 7.34 GB |\n| vae | minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors | 1.17 GB |\n| loras | minimax_h3_pdmd_2nfe_comfyui.safetensors (2-step LoRA, optional) | 1.96 GB |\n\nRepos: Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image, Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3, Comfy-Org/Qwen3.5, akhaliq/minimax-h3-image-pdmd-2step (LoRA by akhaliq, based on the pDMD 2-NFE LoRA). Needs **ComfyUI 0.45.0+**, no custom nodes except rgthree.\nLicence: MiniMax-H3-Image Community License Agreement - read it on the model page before you use it.\nWorkflow by TheLocalLab, built on the official Comfy-Org template."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
