   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Read me - size reference",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Size reference (Pruna)\n| Aspect | 8 MP (text to image) | 4 MP (edits) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1:1 | 2912 x 2912 | 2048 x 2048 |\n| 4:3 | 3360 x 2496 | 2368 x 1760 |\n| 3:4 | 2496 x 3360 | 1760 x 2368 |\n| 3:2 | 3552 x 2368 | 2496 x 1664 |\n| 2:3 | 2368 x 3552 | 1664 x 2496 |\n| 16:9 | 3872 x 2176 | 2720 x 1536 |\n| 9:16 | 2176 x 3872 | 1536 x 2720 |\n\nEdits keep Picture 1's aspect ratio at the megapixels in **Edit size** (4 MP default, 8 max)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Size settings reference\nExact width x height the **Resolution Selector** gives (multiple 32). The 16 MP row = the official Comfy-Org template sizes.\n\n| MP | 1:1 | 3:4 | 4:3 | 2:3 | 3:2 | 9:16 | 16:9 | 21:9 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **1** | 1024 x 1024 | 896 x 1184 | 1184 x 896 | 832 x 1248 | 1248 x 832 | 768 x 1376 | 1376 x 768 | 1568 x 672 |\n| **2** | 1440 x 1440 | 1248 x 1664 | 1664 x 1248 | 1184 x 1760 | 1760 x 1184 | 1088 x 1920 | 1920 x 1088 | 2208 x 960 |\n| **4** | 2048 x 2048 | 1760 x 2368 | 2368 x 1760 | 1664 x 2496 | 2496 x 1664 | 1536 x 2720 | 2720 x 1536 | 3136 x 1344 |\n| **8** | 2912 x 2912 | 2496 x 3360 | 3360 x 2496 | 2368 x 3552 | 3552 x 2368 | 2176 x 3872 | 3872 x 2176 | 4416 x 1888 |\n| **12** | 3552 x 3552 | 3072 x 4096 | 4096 x 3072 | 2912 x 4352 | 4352 x 2912 | 2656 x 4736 | 4736 x 2656 | 5408 x 2336 |\n| **16** | 4096 x 4096 | 3552 x 4736 | 4736 x 3552 | 3360 x 5024 | 5024 x 3360 | 3072 x 5472 | 5472 x 3072 | 6272 x 2688 |\n\n- Edits keep **Picture 1's aspect ratio** at the megapixels set in **Edit size**: **4 MP** default (the 4 MP row), **8 MP** max, **1 MP** for stubborn edits.\n- The model's effective range is about 4-20 MP (official); for edits stay at 4-8 MP."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
